{"q":{"g":"The \"microwave on the 3rd floor of dorms\" is located in the \"kitchen\" (Big room without door) of the 3 story dorms on Customs. The \"middle wooden cabin at the sawmill\" means the wooden cabin #2 in the lumber yard on Woods.","sh":[{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/c/c8/Dorm_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20181204124832","c":"\"Kitchen\" location marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/0/00/Chumm_micro.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20221206111916","c":"The wanted microwave"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/4/4e/Chumm_micro2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20220916211212","c":"The goldchains have to be placed inside the open microwave"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/4/46/Wood_Cabin_nr_2.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20220130010245","c":"Cabin marked on map"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/d/d3/Cabin2Woods.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20230618181031","c":"Cabin #2 at the lumber yard"},{"u":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/escapefromtarkov_gamepedia/images/a/ab/Chumm_woods.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20220822190941","c":"The bed with the book near the safe where the goldchains need to be placed"}]},"o":{},"x":{}}